    "instructions": [
      "Heat olive oil in a pan, cook onion and garlic until soft.",
      "Add carrot and cook for 3-4 mins.",
      "Add crumbled smoked tofu and cook until lightly browned.",
      "Stir in paprika, oregano, and pepper.",
      "Add lentils, chopped tomatoes, and stock/water.",
      "Simmer for 20-25 mins until lentils are soft.",
      "Add water if needed to maintain a thick sauce consistency.",
      "Serve over cooked whole grain spaghetti."
